    "body": "I was specifically thinking about the new tag since blocking on an #id seems inherently more risky if it's not actually in the doc. Agreed this wouldn't make sense to apply to all render blocking cases. ",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
